<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Chinese (Traditional), a draft not yet read by a fluent reviewer (#495). The notes on each string are in
    values/strings.xml. Written in Taiwan usage, readable in Hong Kong; the driver is addressed as 你.
    "Vehicle" is 車輛, the general word, never a word for one kind of vehicle; "route" is 路線; "run" is 班次;
    "trip" is 行程; "stop" is 站 (下一站, 站點); "block" is 排班; "agency" is 營運單位; "dispatcher" is 調度員;
    "report" is 回報, counted with 筆; "timetable" and "schedule" are both 時刻表; "on time" is 準點, and
    "late" and "early" are 晚 and 早, as rail boards write "晚 3 分"; "diagnostics" is 診斷資訊.
    Location words follow Android's own: 位置資訊, 精確位置, 大概位置, 一律允許.
    Chinese has one plural form, so each plural has its "other" item alone.
-->
